# Deprecated migration marker.
#
# The packaged user service no longer imports ~/.config/openburnbar/daemon.env.
# Generic environment files can inject shell or dynamic-loader behavior before
# the root-owned launcher establishes its trust boundary. Use the reviewed
# custom-xdg systemd drop-in example for support/socket path customization.
# Never put auth tokens, peer roots, BASH_ENV, NODE_OPTIONS, or LD_* variables
# in a service override.
